      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">·  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">ratio_gin = ratio_gout = 0.5, 通道一半走频域 (SpectralTransform)</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">·  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">FFT 把 H/16 空间特征转到频域, 1×1 Conv 等价空间域全局加权</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">·  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">在 H/16 即便有较大下采样, 仍可能覆盖不全图像; FFC 在此弥补全局视野</span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">·  </span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">以残差形式注入, 保留 ResNet/Swin 已有结构信息</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 7a6e3664fabcea23ca452e57793e85ebca010c396f714ff3f13f8fb6b17bd0b3
